     139.11801147460938,
     324.5805969238281,
     166.9590301513672
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "Suppose you’re digging through your grandma’s attic and come across a \nmysterious locked suitcase.",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     9.5,
     285.8179931640625,
     322.083740234375,
     313.65899658203125
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "Grandma tells you that the key for the suitcase is probably in this other \nbox.",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     9.5,
     508.3580017089844,
     325.41455078125,
     549.2009887695312
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "This box contains more boxes, with more boxes inside those boxes. The \nkey is in a box somewhere. What’s your algorithm to search for the key? \nThink of an algorithm before you read on.",
    "is_code": false
