    "is_code": true
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     27.5,
     116.11801147460938,
     328.0035400390625,
     143.9590301513672
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "Write out this code and run it. You’ll notice a problem: this function \nwill run forever!",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     36.5,
     226.3086395263672,
     157.96585083007812,
     235.3086395263672
    ],
    "font": "Courier",
    "size": 9.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "> 3...2...1...0...-1...-2...",
    "is_code": true
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     27.5,
     241.79800415039062,
     169.57264709472656,
     256.6369934082031
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "(Press Ctrl-C to kill your script.)",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     27.49999237060547,
     259.29901123046875,
     341.9624938964844,
     326.14605712890625
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "When you write a recursive function, you have to tell it when to stop \nrecursing. That’s why every recursive function has two parts: the base \ncase and the recursive case. The recursive case is when the function calls \nitself. The base case is when the function doesn’t call itself again, so it \ndoesn’t go into an infinite loop.",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     27.49999237060547,
     328.8080749511719,
     238.42169189453125,
     343.6470642089844
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "Let’s add a base case to the countdown function:",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     36.5,
     350.98199462890625,
     134.65396118164062,
     410.3036193847656
    ],
    "font": "Courier-Bold",
    "size": 9.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "def countdown(i):\n  print(i)\n  if i <= 1:      \n    return\n  else:           \n    countdown(i-1)",
    "is_code": true
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     36.50001525878906,
     421.3016357421875,
     99.14453887939453,
     430.3016357421875
    ],
    "font": "Courier",
    "size": 9.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "countdown(3)",
    "is_code": true
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
