     197.9300079345703
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "Notice that each call to fact has its own copy of x. You can’t access a \ndifferent function’s copy of x.",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     27.49700927734375,
