     331.6523742675781,
     228.43101501464844
    ],
    "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
    "size": 11.0,
    "color": 2301728,
    "text": "The stack plays a big part in recursion. In the opening example, there \nwere two approaches to finding the key. Here’s the first way again.",
    "is_code": false
   },
   {
    "bbox": [
     27.5,
     422.3769836425781,
